abstract: "Code, minimum author-created derived data and supplementary tables for verification of a global oasis exposure assessment, covering 3,437 oases and 31 primary estimands. Code is released under the MIT licence; the author-created derived data and documentation are released under CC BY 4.0, as stated in LICENSE-DATA. No third-party raw raster, reanalysis or boundary-geometry file is redistributed."
